    "pads": "cut-only analytical pads shared by renderer and physics; continuous six-metre bank release replaces R8 quantisation and atlas resolution/cap limits",
    "presentation": "no mountain exaggeration or earth-curvature displacement in the authority surface",
    "streams": "legacy additional stream-mask carving and hydrographic validation not yet migrated; detail raster retains its pre-existing authored drainage relief"
